  "summary": "An object which represents a group in the system contacts address book.",
  "description": "See examples in [Titanium.Contacts](api:Titanium.Contacts) for more information.\n\nThese APIs are unavailable on macOS if the app is built on a version of Xcode < 12.\n",
  "properties": [
    {
      "name": "identifier",
